MoonFat is an independent MoonBit implementation of the FAT12/16/32
on-disk layout described by the Microsoft FAT specification.

Volume layout decisions and the overall read/write API were informed by
rust-fatfs:

  https://github.com/rafalh/rust-fatfs
  Copyright 2017 Rafal Harabien
  License: MIT

The rust-fatfs MIT license text is reproduced in THIRD_PARTY/rust-fatfs.MIT.
This repository does not include rust-fatfs source files.
